# =====================================================================
# CEK DPM — Aplikasi Evaluasi Billing
# Salin file ini menjadi .env (lokal) atau isi Environment Variables di Vercel
# =====================================================================

# --- Lokal / sandbox (SQLite, untuk development) ---
DATABASE_URL="file:./db/custom.db"

# --- Produksi (Vercel + Supabase) ---
# 1. Buat proyek di https://supabase.com
# 2. Jalankan supabase/schema.sql di SQL Editor
# 3. Ambil connection string: Project Settings → Database → Connection string → URI (pooler, port 6543)
#    bentuknya: postgresql://postgres.xxx:<PASSWORD>@aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres
# 4. Ubah provider di prisma/schema.prisma dari "sqlite" menjadi "postgresql"
#    (bisa otomatis: bash scripts/switch-supabase.sh)
# 5. Set nilai ini di Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables:
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres.xxxx:PASSWORD@aws-0-region.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres?pgbouncer=true&connection_limit=1"
